{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方第一块大号白字标题，紫色强调的“那些气不该忍”最醒目；随后下方蓝色强调的大标题也很容易吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"只抓到他仍对过去的事不服气，似乎一直在和过去较劲；具体处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、难受。\",\n  \"missed\": \"不服气如何逐渐淡去、他已经不在那些人身边，以及从无力继续争执到想到过去而难受的关系，需要读完整句并结合上下两块才能理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块字号和视觉权重相近的大标题争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块里，要拼接才能看出情绪从不服气到逐渐无力、转为难受的变化。\",\n    \"单块标题较长，一块里包含好几层意思。\",\n    \"放大的强调词本身说不清完整处境和感受，需要依赖周围文字补全。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8d0e1b9e-a3dc-42d2-a9fd-11a41ce21b1b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012904292772Z", "elapsed_seconds": 30.218, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:29:34.520778+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "253d768345a8bfb4a3d55c3e4eee4ce27896288c9790260750f43fc9141a9589", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f